# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The files ported from the Classic ASP site arrived CRLF (and a few mixed),
# so a Python rewrite of one of them silently turned the whole file into a
# one-line-per-line diff. `eol=lf` also stops a Windows checkout from
# reintroducing CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.parquet binary
